1794962222789588	sippycup-2u2m2v	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-yfj	{"body":"Merged to main in 4c319b1: optional Asterisk 22.12.0 image (100 MB, ~1 min build), practice-target build/up/down/status/info, global --practice (joins the target's loopback-only namespace; rootless capture, no sudo), and make practice-gate (38 checks; fails when the 526b854 fixes are reverted). Lead verification on the merged tree: 539 host tests, practice-gate, and the guided call composed with --practice."}	blake3:RX-6DDNzfe2pVdIM1TI_-nvM2ivCIHc_Wrvry47TTow
1794962222804294	sippycup-2u2m2v	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-2ky	{"body":"Closed after proving the open items against the practice target: sippycup --practice call with Digest registration passes (registered, 300 RTP packets each way, oracle pass=10 fail=0); an unauthenticated call is challenged with 401; a 486 destination is reported as not answered; a wrong password makes exactly one credentialed REGISTER; the password is absent from the run directory. Remaining polish: a failed registration reports 'status unknown' instead of the SIP status. TLS through the call command is not yet proven (server-name pinning is bn-1bi)."}	blake3:qyumDB2LwPnawZWBw2agQAfanuhlbwB1LlwwqywZyN0
