1794962292243673	sippycup-2u2m2v	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-20j	{"description":"Problem\nReview of the guided call (bn-2ky) and practice target (bn-yfj) left small defects that do not block a baseline call but make its output or image less trustworthy.\n\nItems\n- A failed registration reports \"status unknown\" instead of the SIP status (seen with a wrong password against the practice target: the capture shows the 401, the report does not).\n- The evidence manifest of a call run lists campaign-only files (plan.json, reviewed-manifest.yaml, commands.json, ...) as missingExpected, so every guided call looks incomplete.\n- If the orchestrator raises between creating the run directory and entering its cleanup block, a partial run directory is left with no result.json.\n- The Containerfile copies sippycup-web-security, web-security-profile, and web-security-evidence but never marks them executable in the image; it works only because the build context files are already 0755.\n- `journal init` refuses a directory that already exists, so the journal must be created before `scope init`; either accept an existing empty-of-journal directory or have the advisor say so.\n\nAcceptance\n- A wrong-password guided call against the practice target reports registration status 401.\n- `evidence manifest` on a passing guided-call run directory reports no missing expected files.\n- Each item has a regression test or is covered by an existing gate.","kind":"task","labels":["usability","live"],"parent":"bn-za4","title":"Polish guided call reporting, evidence manifest, and image permissions"}	blake3:VGDSd3XazQiBRT-uZvg8a6utH1ek4PQUY5VkVc0fTxw
1794963997667361	sippycup-2u2m2v	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-1c5	{"body":"Merged to main. Lead verification on the merged tree: 570 host tests; smoke, selftest, campaign-selftest, call-selftest, campaign-softphone-selftest, mcp-exit-gate, practice-gate all exit 0. Against the practice target with --practice campaign run: authenticated call campaign succeeded (registered, 250 RTP packets each way, INVITE rejected 0); a wrong password failed after exactly one credentialed REGISTER and no INVITE; the password is absent from the run directory. Not done: DTMF, TLS/TCP softphone campaigns, forcing the local RTP port into the authorized range."}	blake3:Z73jU0RXoIPnJNO9qtSBogx1pMcfWjqaWlDEGWfm46Q
1794963997683674	sippycup-2u2m2v	itc:AQ		item.move	bn-1c5	{"state":"done"}	blake3:nz_e0z-jagkI8ZfUCH5VlpkZEhflFRLCh_lZhFPsclM
1794964377250979	sippycup-2u2m2v	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-2tb	{"body":"Merged to main. sipsak and both hostname workarounds are gone; preflight and campaign options steps use lib/sippycup/options.py. Lead verification on the merged tree: 600 host tests; smoke, selftest, campaign-selftest, call-selftest, campaign-softphone-selftest, mcp-exit-gate, practice-gate exit 0; by hand against the practice target: UDP pass, TLS with practice CA and server name pass, no CA exit 5, wrong name exit 5, --tls-unverified reported UNVERIFIED, closed TCP exit 4, closed UDP exit 3. Exit codes changed (0-5 scale); --tls-ignore-cert-failure removed. A 5xx/6xx preflight response is a recorded warning, not a failure."}	blake3:u_ipyrozzSLYUkQMS7SOTvRVgDXBrBzLPQhKdpFlLBo
