1794967426080518	sippycup-2u2m2v	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-1bi	{"body":"Merged to main. Lead verification on the merged tree: 632 host tests; smoke, selftest, campaign-selftest, call-selftest, campaign-softphone-selftest, mcp-exit-gate, practice-gate exit 0. By hand against the practice target: rehearse ready for the TLS profile; guided call over TLS passes with the certificate verified for the reviewed name; a wrong name fails at preflight with no call placed; a TLS campaign (verified, registered, 200) succeeds; a CA file changed after planning is refused with exit 2. Limits: only TLS 1.2 observed; call ceiling cannot count INVITEs inside TLS; no public-CA target tested."}	blake3:lKFzK_Wu-wMlt8XSgqZLYbWaYtdArdEgQvOv9RnWEK4
