1795026671767679	sippycup-2u2m2v	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-1qm	{"description":"Scope intake accepts media.networks as CIDRs but the profile lists only literal approved_addresses, so a guided call to a platform with a media pool (the usual case) stops with media-outside-scope. Driver already supports allowed_media_networks (campaigns use it). Add an optional profile media.networks, validate it in rehearse, pass it through call/matrix/srtp-policy, and teach summary integrity checks, cockpit and ladder about it, without widening what signaling may reach.","kind":"task","labels":["safety"],"size":"m","title":"Honour owner-approved media CIDRs in the guided call, checks, matrix and owner report"}	blake3:_1cJXLx0yxCb0Yl_T17LaYjE8IxoufBcn0IXcLT8Izs
