1795030088942236	sippycup-2u2m2v	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-24x	{"description":"lib/sippycup/campaign.py:1269-1288 derives the capture filter from the signaling host only and lib/sippycup/runtime.py:1063 requires the plan filter to equal it, so in the proxy shape campaign RTP to the media pool is not captured and the packet ceiling does not count it. Fix needs a plan-derivation change that keeps old frozen plans valid.","kind":"bug","labels":["safety"],"size":"m","title":"Campaign capture and watchdog miss RTP to a media address that differs from the signaling host"}	blake3:7BacPRO-3dJ6ahxDs1EeFU22AarsjNUlcpcYsU7Uapo
