1795051068118706	sippycup-2u2m2v	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-3oib	{"description":"From the bn-2sfa fix. Sequential campaign steps are now attributed by dialog lifetime; overlapping calls are not. Give each step a distinct --rtp-port or feed step start/end times from events.jsonl to the oracle. Also: tests/oracle is not run by the host suite (no __init__.py), only by make oracle-test.","kind":"bug","size":"m","title":"Oracle cannot separate a TLS call's RTP from a concurrent cleartext call: every PJSUA call binds local RTP port 4000"}	blake3:50zhtXqCos4l-dk86z21B6yhdyPTsL8693DX3JKbNOU
